Everything is based on memory.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Warfare is a war, action film directed by Ray Mendoza.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
A platoon of Navy SEALs embarks on a dangerous mission in Ramadi, Iraq, with the
chaos and brotherhood of war retold through their memories of the event.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Ray, played by D'Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Erik, played by Will Poulter.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Elliott, played by Cosmo Jarvis.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Tommy, played by Kit Connor.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
John, played by Finn Bennett.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
