10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Warfare is a 2025 war film written and directed by Ray Mendoza and Alex Garland.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Based on Mendoza's experiences during the Iraq War as a U.S.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Navy SEAL, the film depicts an encounter on 19
November 2006 after the Battle of Ramadi.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The script is drawn from the testimonies of the platoon
members and is presented in real time.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It stars an ensemble cast including D'Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai as Mendoza, alongside Will Poulter,
Cosmo Jarvis, Kit Connor, Finn Bennett, Joseph Quinn, and Charles Melton.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film is dedicated to platoon member Elliott Miller (portrayed by Jarvis in
the film), who lost his leg and ability to speak in the incident.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Warfare premiered at the Music Box Theatre in Chicago on 16 March 2025, and was released in the
United States by A24 on 11 April 2025, and in the United Kingdom on 18 April.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film received positive reviews and has grossed $33.6 million worldwide.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of u.s. navy seal,
docudrama, iraq war, platoon, real time.
